                                                "example_id": "6cb9fc03-6e0c-4cc8-af78-2ef57f637eaa",
                                                "sense_id": "7b27ca2f-34d0-3a8d-aca6-a4feceb3d3ad",
                                                "text": "I paid for my beans and sipped my perfectly-made Gibraltar as I walked down the street thinking about how I would now always order from his pizza company."
